  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustaining Integration of the TSD Methodology and Local Partner Resilience in Mine Action in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Sustaining Integration of the TSD Methodology and Local Partner Resilience in Mine Action in Ukraine - This 18-month exceptional assistance measure will mobilise relevant assistance to sustain the momentum of humanitarian mine action in Ukraine by notably strenghtening capacities of local mine action actors, as well as via expanding technical survey and demining operations, including via the further rollout of local canine teams.</narrative>
  </description>
